SUMMARY:Entrepreneurship Roundtable with OPEN
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://form.jotform.com/253065225589059 \nThis event will be a facilitated discussion bringing together founders\, builders\, and innovators to explore what it takes to create\, scale\, and sustain meaningful ventures. Every roundtable will have different topics of discussion as well. Here is the following criteria for individuals to join: \n1. Emerging Founders \n– Actively developing a startup\, product\, or business concept\n– May be pre-revenue or early revenue (<$500K ARR)\nCommitted to launching or validating their idea within the next 12 months \n2. Established Entrepreneurs \n– Have founded or co-founded a company (past or present)\n– Are seeking to scale\, pivot\, or build their “next best thing”\n– Have raised funding\, bootstrapped\, or achieved meaningful revenue milestones \n3. Intrapreneurs & Innovators \n– Corporate or technical professionals building new initiatives\, divisions\, or technologies within their organizations\n– Interested in transitioning to entrepreneurship or investing in early-stage ventures \nThose who are selected will be sent a link to purchase their optional lunch ticket for $20. The cost is to cover the food. If you opt out of lunch\, the event is free.
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/entrepreneurship-roundtable-with-open-4/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Entrepreneurship_Roundtable_Promo-1.png?ver=1785886191
END:VEVENT
