SUMMARY:Industrious Coworking Day: Summer Series
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/c1h8xq1m \n​Summer Co-Working Day at Industrious \n​Join us at Industrious on August 27th from 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM for a full day of productivity\, connection\, and community. Experience what it’s like to work from our vibrant workspace with complimentary coworking for the day\, high-speed WiFi\, and opportunities to meet other professionals in the building. \n​We’ll kick off the morning with breakfast\, followed by specialty snacks from a featured caterer\, and plenty of opportunities for networking throughout the day. Our team will also be offering guided tours of the space and sharing upcoming programming and events happening in the community. \n​To wrap up the day\, join us for a happy hour from 4:00 – 5:00 PM — drinks are on us as we continue the conversation and celebrate the Industrious community. \n​What to expect: \n​Complimentary coworking from 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM \n​Breakfast to start your day \n​Specialty snacks from a guest caterer \n​Networking opportunities with members and guests \n​Free high-speed WiFi \n​Workspace tours and insights into upcoming programming \n​Happy Hour (4:00 – 5:00 PM) — drinks on us \n​Parking:\nParking is free for the first 3 hours\, then $10 for the remainder of the day. \n​Come work\, connect\, and experience a day in the life at Industrious. We look forward to welcoming you!
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/industrious-coworking-day-summer-series-2/
LOCATION:Industrious\, 4201 Main St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Community-Coworking-Day-the-Ion-5.png?ver=1784644629
END:VEVENT
