SUMMARY:Illuminate: The Official Launch Experience
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/LaunchExperience \n​Illuminate is the official public launch experience for Lumino. Join founders\, merchants\, creators\, investors\, and community leaders for a full day of keynotes\, industry breakout sessions\, and networking as we unveil the Lumino ecosystem and the future of Local Conscious Commerce. \n​The day moves through three keynote acts — Past\, Present\, and Future — tracing Lumino’s founding story\, what’s live today\, and where the platform is headed. From there\, guests choose an industry-specific breakout session\, hear from a lineup of champion speakers\, and close the day at a happy hour with our first-floor restaurant partners. \n​Agenda \n​8:30 AM Guest arrival \n​9:00–10:00 AM Past — Lumino State of the Union \n​10:00–11:00 AM Present — The Lumino Launch Keynote \n​11:00 AM–11:30 AM Future — The Future of Lumino & Global Conscious Commerce \n​11:30–12:30 PM Lunch\, served in Lower Lobby \n​12:30–1:30 PM Breakout sessions: Non-Profit\, Hospitality\, Online Coaching\, Startup\, Payment Processing \n​2:00–2:30 PM Eric Rock – Mission Project \n​2:30— 3:00 PM Champion Keynote (Coming Soon) \n​3:00–4:00 PM Micro keynotes (15 min each) \n​4:00–6:00 PM Happy hour — 1st floor restaurant partners
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/illuminate-the-official-launch-experience/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
CATEGORIES:3rd Party Registration
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Ion-Website-Design_1080x830.png?ver=1785449581
END:VEVENT
